         data-en="Featuring modern architecture, spacious, airy spaces, and optimized functionality, the hotel includes 25 brand-new, clean, and fully equipped rooms. WINDY Hotel offers a variety of room types to flexibly meet the needs of solo travelers, couples, families, and tour groups.">
